/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * GayDex application layer — catalog, persistence, DOM UI, battle terminal.
 *
 * Battle TRUTH is not computed here.  Every rule, number and roll lives in
 * `src/battle-core.js` (loaded first, exposed as `window.GayDexBattleCore`);
 * this layer only reads its state and renders it.  The Three.js Circuit layer
 * in `src/circuit/` does the same, which is what keeps the world a
 * presentation of the battle rather than a second opinion about it.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
